      "x": 40,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 40,
      "text": "Measure actual worker size:  docker stats $(docker compose ps -q wordpress-fpm) | cat\nOr inside container:  ps aux --no-headers -o rss,comm | awk '/php-fpm/{sum+=$1} END{print sum/NR/1024 \" MB avg\"}'",
